<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>고영향 AI 사전진단 보고서</title>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 16mm;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: #172033;
      font-family:
        "Malgun Gothic",
        "Apple SD Gothic Neo",
        sans-serif;
      font-size: 10pt;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    p {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .report-header {
      padding-bottom: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb;
    }

    .report-eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .report-title {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 24pt;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .report-subtitle {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .section-title {
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 15pt;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    }

    .summary-card {
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .summary-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .summary-result {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-size: 20pt;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .summary-result--not-applicable {
      color: #475569;
    }

    .summary-reason {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .info-item {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .info-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .info-value {
      font-weight: 700;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      table-layout: fixed;
    }

    thead {
      display: table-header-group;
    }

    tr {
      break-inside: avoid;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    th,
    td {
      padding: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: middle;
      word-break: keep-all;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    th {
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 9pt;
      background: #f1f5f9;
    }

    .column-code {
      width: 13%;
    }

    .column-answer {
      width: 11%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .column-weight,
    .column-score {
      width: 10%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .answer-yes {
      color: #047857;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .answer-no {
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .score-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .score-card {
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .score-card--total {
      color: #1d4ed8;
      border-color: #93c5fd;
      background: #eff6ff;
    }

    .score-name {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .score-value {
      font-size: 18pt;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .criteria-box,
    .notice-box {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .criteria-box {
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .notice-box {
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 9pt;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .criteria-box p:last-child,
    .notice-box p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .report-footer {
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 8pt;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="report-header">
    <p class="report-eyebrow">HIGH-IMPACT AI PRE-ASSESSMENT</p>
    <h1 class="report-title">고영향 AI 사전진단 보고서</h1>
    <p class="report-subtitle">
      저장된 문항별 응답과 내부 판정 기준에 따라 자동 생성된 결과서입니다.
    </p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">1. 사전진단 개요</h2>

      <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">감사 ID</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ request.audit_id }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">사전진단 ID</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ request.assessment_id }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">감사명</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ request.audit_name }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">진단 일시</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ assessed_at }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">모델명</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ request.model_name }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <span class="info-label">모델 버전</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ request.model_version or "미기재" }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">2. 최종 판정</h2>

      <div class="summary-card">
        <span class="summary-label">고영향 AI 해당 여부</span>
        <strong
          class="summary-result{% if request.result == 'NOT_APPLICABLE' %} summary-result--not-applicable{% endif %}"
        >
          {{ result_label }}
        </strong>
        <p class="summary-reason">{{ decision_reason }}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">3. 정성 게이트 응답</h2>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="column-code">문항 코드</th>
            <th>진단 문항</th>
            <th class="column-answer">응답</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for answer in qualitative_answers %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ answer.question_code }}</td>
            <td>{{ answer.question_text }}</td>
            <td class="column-answer">
              <span class="{{ 'answer-yes' if answer.answer else 'answer-no' }}">
                {{ "예" if answer.answer else "아니요" }}
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    {% if quantitative_answers %}
    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">4. 정량 배점 응답</h2>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="column-code">문항 코드</th>
            <th>진단 문항</th>
            <th class="column-answer">응답</th>
            <th class="column-weight">배점</th>
            <th class="column-score">획득 점수</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for answer in quantitative_answers %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ answer.question_code }}</td>
            <td>{{ answer.question_text }}</td>
            <td class="column-answer">
              <span class="{{ 'answer-yes' if answer.answer else 'answer-no' }}">
                {{ "예" if answer.answer else "아니요" }}
              </span>
            </td>
            <td class="column-weight">{{ answer.weight }}점</td>
            <td class="column-score">{{ answer.score }}점</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        {{ "5" if quantitative_answers else "4" }}. 점수 산정 결과
      </h2>

      <div class="score-grid">
        <div class="score-card">
          <span class="score-name">A그룹 점수</span>
          <strong class="score-value">{{ request.group_a_score }}점</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="score-card">
          <span class="score-name">B그룹 점수</span>
          <strong class="score-value">{{ request.group_b_score }}점</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="score-card score-card--total">
          <span class="score-name">합산 점수</span>
          <strong class="score-value">{{ request.total_score }}점</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        {{ "6" if quantitative_answers else "5" }}. 판정 기준
      </h2>

      <div class="criteria-box">
        <p>
          정성 게이트 문항 중 하나 이상이 “예”이면 정량 배점 없이
          고영향 AI로 판정합니다.
        </p>
        <p>
          정성 게이트를 충족하지 않은 경우 A그룹과 B그룹의 합산 점수가
          4점 이상이면 고영향 AI로 판정합니다.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        {{ "7" if quantitative_answers else "6" }}. 유의사항
      </h2>

      <div class="notice-box">
        <p>
          본 보고서는 사용자가 제출한 사전진단 응답과 시스템 내부 판정
          기준을 기반으로 자동 생성되었습니다.
        </p>
        <p>
          실제 법적 의무와 적용 범위는 관련 법령, 감독기관 지침 및
          전문가 검토 결과에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="report-footer">
    FinAuditAI · 고영향 AI 사전진단 보고서
  </footer>
</body>
</html>